  "historyNote": "#5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.36); ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15 (from Per 103.37); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.41); renumbered by #14065-A; ss by #14132-A, eff 11-27-24 (formerly Per 102.47); ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.50), eff 12-1-25",
